MLX (https://github.com/ml-explore/mlx)

The one-row Q4 decode projections in
runtime/metal/kernels/decode/linear_q4_qmv.metal follow the geometry and the
in-place nibble masking of MLX's affine qmv_fast kernel
(mlx/backend/metal/kernels/quantized.h, Copyright © 2023-2024 Apple Inc.):
simdgroups of adjacent outputs whose lanes split K, activations prescaled by
the masked nibbles' place values, and scale * dot + bias * sum per chunk.
They are compiled into splash.metallib.

